）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜不戒掉3大壞習慣，晚年恐陷財務困境！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250306/974360906194489344504178.jpeg/gvja1tMKiOOWdm2aLixaJPw_jduiTmIKVwWA4FcFgOA\"/><figcaption>理財｜不戒掉3大壞習慣，晚年恐陷財務困境！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜不戒掉3大壞習慣，晚年恐陷財務困境！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250306/974360908170137600982476.jpeg/1es2EQimFHOv-CFKm-N1C4NNwGn3AhRG1tmOPNbZjjw\"/><figcaption>理財｜不戒掉3大壞習慣，晚年恐陷財務困境！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜不戒掉3大壞習慣，晚年恐陷財務困境！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250306/974360909923487744068154.jpeg/oNsnvpg9K6MiBzFcolnL3wIU7f41TlJwtMVJB7TFSQc\"/><figcaption>理財｜不戒掉3大壞習慣，晚年恐陷財務困境！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「引新聞」授權轉載】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T06:38:43.070990+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1703,"images":42,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}